{"text":"夫冲宗凝湛，非妙像無以啓其原；至道玄微，非詮莫能尋其本。是以闕口趙阿歡諸邑卅五人，體生滅之際，識去流之分，知身浮雲，余如霜露，故各竭家財造彌勒像一區。藉因此福緣，邑□□弟道根扶疏，普外增□□□□□萬善，實侍龍花之期，□□□□□□□□因緣知識。神龜三年六月九日。邑師惠感；吕願德、孫阿歡、張龍虎。邑主趙阿歡；劉運晃、許歡德、韓法智、張同敬。光明主張惠普；趙道成、李雙周、張毛洛、願主□。都維那王吕宣；楊惠抱、胤仰佛慈。維那常智達；枚新德、張休人。維那賈婆羅門；江文宗、鄭天生。維那張惠勝；張同敬、索珍保。邑正許惠但；王神龍、樂代護。□老張伏保；奴、趙胡扶。□□孟莫命；趙當隰。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"伊闕","refId":"PL000000023647","text":"闕口","start":30,"end":32},{"name":"PersonName","term":"趙阿歡","refId":null,"text":"趙阿歡","start":32,"end":35},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":69,"end":71},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"龍花","start":103,"end":105},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":116,"end":118},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"善知識","refId":null,"text":"知識","start":118,"end":120},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑師","refId":null,"text":"邑師","start":130,"end":132},{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠感","refId":null,"text":"惠感","start":132,"end":134},{"name":"PersonName","term":"吕願德","refId":null,"text":"吕願德","start":135,"end":138},{"name":"PersonName","term":"孫阿歡","refId":null,"text":"孫阿歡","start":139,"end":142},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張龍虎","refId":null,"text":"張龍虎","start":143,"end":146},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑主","refId":null,"text":"邑主","start":147,"end":149},{"name":"PersonName","term":"趙阿歡","refId":null,"text":"趙阿歡","start":149,"end":152},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉運晃","refId":null,"text":"劉運晃","start":153,"end":156},{"name":"PersonName","term":"許歡德","refId":null,"text":"許歡德","start":157,"end":160},{"name":"PersonName","term":"韓法智","refId":null,"text":"韓法智","start":161,"end":164},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張同敬","refId":null,"text":"張同敬","start":165,"end":168},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張惠普","refId":null,"text":"張惠普","start":172,"end":175},{"name":"PersonName","term":"趙道成","refId":null,"text":"趙道成","start":176,"end":179},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李雙周","refId":null,"text":"李雙周","start":180,"end":183